{% $product.name %} builds its editor from your content collections. There's no second schema to write. {% .lead %}

{% if $product.beta %}
This is a beta. Expect rough edges, and tell us about them.
{% else /%}
This release is stable.
{% /if %}

## Install

Run one command in your Astro project, then start the dev server and open `/admin`. The {% abbr title="content management system" %}CMS{% /abbr %} appears with every collection already listed.

{% callout type="tip" title="Before you start" %}
You'll need:

- Astro 6 or 7
- at least one collection that uses the `glob()` or `file()` loader
{% /callout %}

